<title>USA: United National Bancorp sets stock, regular divs.</title>
<headline>United National Bancorp sets stock, regular divs.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEWATER, N.J. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>United National Bancorp said Wednesday it has set a six percent stock dividend and a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.27 per share.</p>
<p>Both dividends are payable November 1 to shareholders of record on October 15, the company said.</p>
<p>United National Bancorp is a $1 billion holding company. Its principal subsidiary is United National Bank, which operates 18 offices in New Jersey.</p>
</text>
